{"id":"59e53f2a0f1b0898","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-prop-compact-spectrum.md","title":"Compact Operator Spectrum","display":"prop-compact-spectrum — Compact Operator Spectrum","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-compact-spectrum","aliases":["58-prop-compact-spectrum"],"display":"prop-compact-spectrum — Compact Operator Spectrum","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top3-accumulation-point.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-compact-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-compact-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-compact-spectrum — Compact Operator Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28999e0c83253377\" href=\"?note=28999e0c83253377\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83c37bed44770f30\" href=\"?note=83c37bed44770f30\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md\">../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1360db13be12aa41\" href=\"?note=1360db13be12aa41\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top3-accumulation-point.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-top3-accumulation-point.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md\">../batch09/58-df-dimension.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,d_X\">\\(X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,d_X\\)</span> (a designated complex Banach-space structure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\)</span> (Banach-space predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K:X\\to X\">\\(K:X\\to X\\)</span> (bounded linear operator)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb C)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\)</span> (operator-spectrum relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83c37bed44770f30\" href=\"?note=83c37bed44770f30\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md\">../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3AccumulationPoint}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},S,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3AccumulationPoint}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},S,\\lambda)\\)</span> (accumulation-point predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(n,\\langle E,\\mathbb C,+_X\\upharpoonright E^2,\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb C\\times E),+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1,0_X\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(n,\\langle E,\\mathbb C,+_X\\upharpoonright E^2,\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb C\\times E),+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1,0_X\\rangle)\\)</span> (vector-space dimension predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> is the topology induced by the usual complex metric</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_X=\\odot_X(\\langle0,x\\rangle)\">\\(0_X=\\odot_X(\\langle0,x\\rangle)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，该值由向量空间公理与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 无关）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1\">\\(+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1\\)</span> 为固定复数域运算和单位。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in U)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}compact\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n|S\\setminus\\{0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3AccumulationPoint}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},S,\\lambda)\\to\\lambda=0\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(E=\\{x\\in X:K(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,x\\rangle)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n,\\langle E,\\mathbb C,+_X\\upharpoonright E^2,\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb C\\times E),+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1,0_X\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}compact\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n|S\\setminus\\{0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3AccumulationPoint}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},S,\\lambda)\\to\\lambda=0\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(E=\\{x\\in X:K(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,x\\rangle)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n,\\langle E,\\mathbb C,+_X\\upharpoonright E^2,\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb C\\times E),+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1,0_X\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every nonzero spectral value of a compact operator is an eigenvalue of finite geometric multiplicity.</li>\n<li>Zero is the only possible accumulation point; in finite dimension the accumulation-point set is empty.</li>\n<li>The scalar field, vector operations, norm, metric, spectrum output, identity operator, and accumulation topology are all explicit; the earlier unary Banach and raw <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}\\)</span> notation hid incompatible structure choices.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"28999e0c83253377","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md","status":"resolved","id":"83c37bed44770f30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top3-accumulation-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"1360db13be12aa41","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top3-accumulation-point.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md","status":"resolved","id":"522587a7fec6816a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md","status":"resolved","id":"83c37bed44770f30","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)$ (operator-spectrum relation, see [[../batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,d_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)","display":false},{"tex":"K:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3AccumulationPoint}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},S,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(n,\\langle E,\\mathbb C,+_X\\upharpoonright E^2,\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb C\\times E),+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1,0_X\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"0_X=\\odot_X(\\langle0,x\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|<r\\to w\\in U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}compact\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,K,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n|S\\setminus\\{0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3AccumulationPoint}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},S,\\lambda)\\to\\lambda=0\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(E=\\{x\\in X:K(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,x\\rangle)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n,\\langle E,\\mathbb C,+_X\\upharpoonright E^2,\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb C\\times E),+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1,0_X\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}","display":false}],"bytes":2950,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3947","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-prop-compact-spectrum.md|58-prop-compact-spectrum]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["28999e0c83253377","83c37bed44770f30","ef59807ad934771f","1360db13be12aa41","522587a7fec6816a"]}